scene chamber-queens-treasure
storybook "The Queen's Treasure" "Pearls, and the hands that wore them."
include "_common.cut"

show bg "bg/cham-queentreasure.png" fill
cam 0.5,0.55 zoom 2.0
async zoom to 1.2 over 10.0 ease outcubic

music "victory" fadein 1.5 once
caption "THE QUEEN'S TREASURE" at 66,3 anchor c color gold fade 1.0

show pearls "treasures/silver-necklace.png" scale 3 at 0.42,0.6 fade 1.2
show crown  "treasures/crown-of-gems.png"  scale 3 at 0.60,0.6 fade 1.8

say "It is all still here, which tells you what happened to her."

grant gold 900
caption "+900 GP" at 66,44 anchor c color gold fade 0.6

crawl "she was buried with the small things" "and the great ones were left out" "where anyone could take them" "which is how you know she chose" for 7.0

waitall
musicstop fade 2.0
split over 1.2
